{"id":"basa","lemma":"basa","pos":"noun","rank":4243,"glosses":["base"],"ipa":"/ˈbasa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"basas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Emanuelps27-basa.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿En qué basas tu teoría?","en":"What do you base your theory on?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/551856","words":[{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"what"},null,{"g":"your"},{"g":"theory"}]},{"text":"¿En qué se basa el argumento?","en":"What is the basis for the argument?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705832","words":[{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"what"},{"g":"oneself"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"argument"}]},{"text":"Su teoría se basa en los hechos.","en":"His theory is based on fact.","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"theory"},{"g":"oneself"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"done, completed","l":"hecho"}]},{"text":"Su forma de pensar se basa en su experiencia.","en":"His ideas are based on his experience.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/689187","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"shape"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to think, ponder"},{"g":"oneself"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"experience"}]},{"text":"La obra se basa en hechos reales.","en":"The play is based on true events.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"work"},{"g":"oneself"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"done, completed","l":"hecho"},{"g":"real","l":"real"}]}]}